    {
      "text": "kindreds of earth cannot be blessed unless the Lord makes bare his arm, 1 Ne. 22:10. I am encircled eternally in arms of the Lord’s love, 2 Ne. 1:15. I will not trust in arm of flesh, 2 Ne. 4:34. the Lord’s arm shall judge people, and isles shall trust on his arm, 2 Ne. 8:5 (Isa. 51:5). cursed is he who makes flesh his arm, 2 Ne. 28:31. the Lord’s arm of mercy is extended, Jacob 6:5 (Alma 5:33). Nephites led by power of the Lord’s arm, Omni 1:13. Ammon2 smites off Lamanites’ arms with sword, Alma 17:37. Ammon2 smites arm of Lamoni’s father, Alma 20:20. mercy encircles the repentant in arms of safety, Alma 34:16. Nephites might have been clasped in arms of Jesus, Morm. 5:11.",
