    {
      "text": "arm of the Lord shall be revealed, D&C 1:14 (90:10; 133:3). trust not in arm of flesh, D&C 1:19. the Lord would have extended his arm and supported you, D&C 3:8. the faithful are encircled in arms of the Lord’s love, D&C 6:20. the Lord’s arm is over all earth, D&C 15:2 (16:2). arm of mercy hath atoned for sins, D&C 29:1. the Lord’s arm is not shortened, D&C 35:8 (133:67). the Lord’s arm to fall upon nations, D&C 45:45, 47. rebellious to know the Lord’s arm, D&C 56:1. as well might man stretch forth his puny arm to stop the Missouri, D&C 121:33. the Lord shall make bare his arm in eyes of all nations, D&C 133:3.",
